!.env.example

# --- LOGS ---
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- RUNTIME & DATA ---
pids
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# --- TESTING ---
coverage/
.nyc_output

# --- IDE & EDITORS ---
